          "text": "刷推不想看广告的话，给大家推荐两个第三方的客户端\niOS的话可以用 @NeoFreeBird 最简单的方式是买证书自签sign完就可以sideload他们的IPA了\n这个是直接把X给rebrand回twitter了\n还有可以解锁的local (non server sided) premium功能比如nav bar和主题等等，以及隐藏很多没用的东西\n还可以有很多奇怪的小功能比如显示发推的客户端是什么\n-----Android的话可以用piko twitter，可以直接从这里下APK https://t.co/QFc5RU0DMz 也可以自己用revanced去补丁他们的包\n\nIf you hate ads when mindlessly scrolling down on your phone here are two third party apps you can use for twitter:\nFor iOS check out @NeoFreeBird, the easiest way is buy a certificate and sign & sideload their IPA\nThey literally rebrand the entire X back to Twitter\nOther functions included: unlock local (non server sided) premium such as nav bar customization, theme, app icon etc, and hiding unnecessary components on your timeline\nthere are also auxiliary functions such as showing tweet source label\n-----For Android, you can use piko twitter and download ready to install APKs from https://t.co/QFc5RU0DMz or patch the official ones on your own"
